# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unity 6 project ignore rules.
#
# RULE: generated/machine-specific output must never be committed. Library/,
# Temp/, Logs/ and UserSettings/ are produced locally by the Unity Editor and
# contain absolute paths, caches and per-editor preferences. Committing them
# bloats the repo, causes constant merge conflicts, and can break other
# machines when Unity re-imports stale caches.
#
# What SHOULD be committed: Assets/, Packages/ (manifest + lock), ProjectSettings/,
# .opencode/ (project agent config), Docs/, README.md, AGENTS.md, .gitignore,
# .gitattributes, .github/.
# `.vsconfig` is intentionally committed (shared Visual Studio component list).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Unity generated folders ------------------------------------------------
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/
/[Ee]xportedObj/

# Asset Store tools / package cache artifacts
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ssetStoreTools*
/[Aa]ssets/[Pp]lugins/[Ee]ditor/*.dll.mdb

# --- Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code / IntelliJ ----------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj

# --- Unity / Mono debug + build metadata -----------------------------------
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.svd
*.tmp

# --- Build outputs ---------------------------------------------------------
*.apk
*.aab
*.app

# NOTE: `*.unitypackage` is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Exported .unitypackage files are Git LFS-tracked in `.gitattributes`, so an
# ignore rule here made that LFS configuration dead config. They are not
# ignored any more, but must still be added deliberately by explicit path
# only — never via `git add .`.

# --- Crash / diagnostic reports -------------------------------------------
crashlytics-build.properties
sysinfo.txt

# --- OS junk ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Exception: .opencode/ is intentional project configuration ------------
# Do NOT add .opencode/ here. Do NOT add Assets/ or Packages/manifest.json.
